  "type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
  "data": {
    "body": "A string is wrapped around a Yo-Yo of mass $M$ and moment of inertia $I$. With your hand you pull the string vertically straight up with some constant force $F$ such that the center of the Yo-Yo does not move up or down, but the Yo-Yo spins faster and faster. When your hand is a height $y_0$ above the floor, the Yo-Yo has an angular speed of $\\omega_0$. \n\nWhat is the \\textbf{angular speed}, $\\omega$ of the Yo-Yo when your hand has risen to a height $y$ = $y_0$ + $\\Delta y$ above the floor?",
    "solution": [
      3
    ],
    "answerChoices": [
      {
        "id": "28616bef-46eb-47a4-8103-15cb51da7584",
        "index": 0,
        "body": "$\\omega$ = $\\sqrt{\\frac{2Mgy}{I} - \\omega_0^2}$",
